WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.498
For equal denominators, compare numerators. If denominators differ, first make

00:00:05.498 --> 00:00:06.557
equivalent fractions.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:13.891
Compare 4/12 blank 9/12. The answer is less than . Both have denominator 12; compare

00:00:13.891 --> 00:00:15.196
4 and 9.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:22.778
Two teams in a craft workshop completed 7/10 and 3/10 of their tasks. Choose the sign

00:00:22.778 --> 00:00:26.572
for 7/10 blank 3/10. Pause the video and think.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:34.056
Two teams in a craft workshop completed 7/10 and 3/10 of their tasks. Choose the sign

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:40.662
for 7/10 blank 3/10. The answer is greater than . Both have denominator 10; compare 7

00:00:40.662 --> 00:00:41.487
